- pgvector (PostgreSQL License). A runtime dependency of the extension,
  installed from its own packages; not bundled here.
- The Rust dependency tree, under the licenses its crates declare
  (`cargo license` in this repository enumerates them). The release pipeline's
  audit gate (packaging/postvec/scripts/audit.sh) runs against both lockfiles.

The `engine/` and `shared/` crates are a trimmed fork of UniVec's internal
inference engine; see engine/FORK.md for provenance and the deletion record.
